    <bpmn:process id="W_W4749" name="W4749. Rental Fleet Telematics, GPS Tracking &amp; Geofence Deployment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vehicle commissioning (W4746); telematics-vendor contract; theft/non-return event (W4763)
Frequency: Per vehicle + continuous monitoring
Volume: ~600–800 telematics-equipped vehicles; continuous GPS data
Owner: Rental Program Manager / Fleet Telematics (VS-06)
Participants: Telematics vendor, IT (VS-27), LP (VS-23), Privacy (VS-91)
Source: workflow W4749 — Rental Fleet Telematics, GPS Tracking &amp; Geofence Deployment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4749_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4749_Lane1" name="Fleet Telematics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4749_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4749_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4749_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4749_Lane2" name="Privacy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4749_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4749_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4749_Start4" name="Vehicle commissioning (W4746); telematics-vendor contract; theft/non-return event (W4763)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4749_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4749_Task5" name="Deploy telematics/GPS on every rental vehicle: real-time location, ignition…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Deploy telematics/GPS on every rental vehicle: real-time location, ignition on/off, speed, harsh-event (brake/corner/accel) detection, mileage capture (for billing W4758), fuel level, and OBD/DTC fault codes; integrate to the rental platform and the fleet/LP view
Responsible (R): Fleet Telematics / IT
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager
Duration: Per vehicle + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4749_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4749_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4749_Task6" name="Configure geofences: permitted operating radius (e.g., within the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Configure geofences: permitted operating radius (e.g., within the province/island), no-ferry/no-cross-island rules unless authorized, blacklisted areas, and time-of-day curfew windows; auto-alert on breach (links LP VS-23 and the rental-desk)
Responsible (R): Fleet Telematics / LP / Rental Program Manager
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / LP Director
Duration: Per store + continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4749_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4749_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4749_Task7" name="Govern the privacy dimension: customer-driving telematics is personal data…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govern the privacy dimension: customer-driving telematics is personal data under RA 10173 — disclose at rental (W4755 waiver), minimize collected data, secure it (VS-27.3), and retain only per policy (VS-88); coordinate with the DPO (VS-91)
Responsible (R): Privacy / IT / Rental Program Manager
Accountable (A): DPO / Rental Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4749_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4749_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4749_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4749_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-94 (ensure rental fleet safety &amp; settlement integrity.) | - CTL-716: GPS on every vehicle; geofence + curfew configured per store; telematics disclosed at rental (RA 10173); data secured/minimized
Owner: Rental Program Manager / Fleet Telematics (VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
