        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-716 (ensure controlled execution — Rental Fleet Strategy, Acquisition &amp; Lifecycle Management (PA-162.1).) | - CTL-716: weekly availability review; rebalancing within region; utilization data feeds annual sizing
Owner: Rental Program Manager / Fleet Logistics (VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
