    <bpmn:process id="W_W4752" name="W4752. Rental Vehicle End-of-Life Disposition, Remarketing &amp; Replacement Cycle" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vehicle reaching age/mileage/km cap (~3–5 yr / ~80–120k km); uneconomic repair; total-loss claim (W4762)
Frequency: Per vehicle + rolling ~150–250/yr
Volume: ~150–250 retirements/yr across 200 stores
Owner: Rental Program Manager / Fleet &amp; Asset (VS-06/VS-35)
Participants: Finance/Asset (VS-35), Procurement (VS-03), Insurance (VS-26), Legal (VS-100)
Source: workflow W4752 — Rental Vehicle End-of-Life Disposition, Remarketing &amp; Replacement Cycle</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4752_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4752_Lane1" name="Fleet">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4752_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4752_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4752_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4752_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4752_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4752_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4752_Start4" name="Vehicle reaching age/mileage/km cap (~3–5 yr / ~80–120k km); uneconomic repair…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4752_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4752_Task5" name="Identify vehicles reaching the replacement cap (age/km) or uneconomic-to-repair…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify vehicles reaching the replacement cap (age/km) or uneconomic-to-repair threshold from telematics (W4749) &amp; maintenance records (W4750); validate against depreciation schedule &amp; book value (VS-35); trigger replacement ordering (W4746)
Responsible (R): Fleet / Asset Mgmt
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / Finance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4752_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4752_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4752_Task6" name="Decommission the vehicle: remove telematics (W4749) &amp; livery, recover plates/CR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Decommission the vehicle: remove telematics (W4749) &amp; livery, recover plates/CR for LTO transfer/cancellation (W4747), wipe any on-board data (privacy VS-91), and determine disposition — trade-in to OEM dealer (W4746), wholesale remarketing, internal reassignment, or scrap (DENR-compliant end-of-life vehicle disposal VS-73/VS-114)
Responsible (R): Fleet / Asset / LP
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / Finance
Duration: Per vehicle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4752_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4752_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4752_Task7" name="Realize residual value, post fixed-asset disposal &amp; gain/loss (VS-35 W39…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Realize residual value, post fixed-asset disposal &amp; gain/loss (VS-35 W39 pattern), and reconcile to the depreciation schedule; feed actual residuals into the next unit-economics case (W4745)
Responsible (R): Finance / Asset Mgmt
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / CFO
Duration: Per vehicle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4752_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4752_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4752_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4752_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-716 (ensure controlled execution — Rental Fleet Strategy, Acquisition &amp; Lifecycle Management (PA-162.1).) | - CTL-716: vehicles retired at age/km cap; plates/CR transferred/cancelled; on-board data wiped; disposal posted (VS-35)
Owner: Rental Program Manager / Fleet &amp; Asset (VS-06/VS-35)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
